{"availability":"available","full":"youssef336/flutter-deps-watch","name":"flutter-deps-watch","description":"افحص باكدجات أي مشروع Flutter على GitHub: إيه القديم وإيه اللي بيكسر وإيه عليه ثغرة وبأي ترتيب تحدّث، كله في المتصفح.","category":"Other","language":"JavaScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-10-11T11:21:03Z","updated":"2026-10-15T08:30:56Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://youssef336.github.io/flutter-deps-watch/","topics":["dart","dependencies","flutter","github-pages","javascript","pub-dev","pubspec","security-advisories"],"demo":"https://youssef336.github.io/flutter-deps-watch/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-18T09:13:01.460Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-18T09:13:01.460Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-18T09:13:01.460Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-12T02:05:33.686Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-18T09:13:01.460Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Flutter"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Paste any Flutter repo from GitHub and see, package by package, what is outdated, what will break, what is vulnerable, and in which order to upgrade.","English summary. Flutter Deps Watch is a zero-backend, zero-build web tool (Arabic UI). Give it a GitHub repo link and it reads pubspec.yaml, pubspec.lock and the pinned Flutter version, asks pub.dev about every dependency (latest version, SDK requirement, discontinued status, pub points, security advisories), unpacks each package's archive in the browser to show only the CHANGELOG entries between your version and the latest (split into breaking / new / fixed, with hits in your code), counts how many files in lib/ import it, and sorts everything into vulnerable / locked / breaking / needs…","حط لينك أي repo Flutter على GitHub، والصفحة تقولك حالة كل باكدج في pubspec.yaml: إيه القديم، وإيه اللي هيكسر، وإيه اللي عليه ثغرة، وبأي ترتيب تحدّث. كله بيشتغل في المتصفح: مفيش server، ولا تسجيل دخول، ولا build step."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://githu